<title>JAPAN: Moody's assigns Aa2 to Hewlett-Packard's samurais.</title>
<headline>Moody's assigns Aa2 to Hewlett-Packard's samurais.</headline>
<dateline>TOKYO 1996-10-09</dateline>
<text>
<p>Moody's Investors Service said on Wednesday that it had assigned an Aa2 rating to Hewlett-Packard Co's 50 billion yen of yen/U.S. dollar dual currency samurai bonds due October 1999.</p>
</text>
